			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>UUID</key>
				<string>7AB4B304-F49A-4519-A754-A29815048791</string>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Toggles a Traggo timer. Running timer: stop it (and stop + reset the Clock stopwatch). Otherwise: pick a label, start one tagged immersion=&lt;label&gt; and start the Clock stopwatch so the elapsed time shows in the Live Activity. The two Text blocks below hold the Traggo URL and a device token (answered on import; edit them here to change).</string>
